From 309407c28f0067ed2ff51519b2043d14960e0464 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 13:36:21 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(desktop/kanban): Blocked sidebar section groups cards by
 the chat managing them [daveey]

- /board cards carry managing_session_id: latest tui notify subscriber, else
  the creating session
- GET /api/plugins/kanban/session-labels?ids= returns each session's live
  compression tip + title
- Blocked section: one header row per managing chat (click opens it on the
  local gateway), its cards indented below; sessionless cards last
